# Mobile Design System

- Colors from `src/theme/colors.ts`: background `#0B0F1B`, surface `#151C2B`, border `#303C52`, ember `#FF6542`, electric `#27C9EC`, gold `#FFB84D`.
- Use brand logos under `assets/brand`.
- Dark cinematic UI; no Pokémon brand symbols from mockups.
